exports[`prompt templates > today.plan renders stably (snapshot) 1`] = `
{
  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "## Learner context
Interest: Conversational German — wants to learn: Get conversational in German
Why: personal_goal — Partner’s family is in Munich; I want to hold my own at dinner. · Experience: explored — Two Duolingo streaks that died; I can order food.
Rhythm: several_weekly, 10-minute sessions
Approach notes: You learn a language by understanding messages and being pushed to produce them. We’ll pair short comprehensible input — reading and listening slightly above your level — with small speaking and writing reps every session, so recognition turns into production.
### Path (in order)
